(c4) ()4. Con[Be comforted, be comforted, my people: thy salvation shall come quickly:](f)so(g)lá(h')mi(h)ni,(h.) con(f)so(g)lá(h')mi(h)ni,(h.) pó(h)pu(g)le(j) mé(ixji)us:(h.) (;) 
ci(h')to(h) vé(k')ni(j)et(j.) sál(ixi)us(h) tú(hg)a:(f.) (:) 
qua[why does mourning consume thee, because your sadness is renewed?](h)re(ixi) moe(j)ró(j)re(jk) con(j)sú(ixji)me(h)ris,(h.) (;) 
qui(h)a(h) in(h)no(h)vá(h)vit(h) te(gf) dó(ixfi)lor?(h.) (:) 
Sal[I will save thee, be not afraid, for I am the Lord your God,](k)vá(ixji)bo(h) te,(h_') (,) nó(h)li(g') ti(h)mé(fg)re,(fe..) (:) 
é(f)go(gh) e(h)nim(h_') sum(h) Dó(k')mi(j)nus(j') Dé(ixi)us(h) tú(hg)us,(f.) (;) 
Sánc[the holy one of Israel, thy redeemer.](h)tus(h) Is(ixhi)ra(h)el,(h_') Re(g)démp(gf)tor(e) tú(fe)us.(d.) (::)
Ro(f)rá(gh)te.(h.) (::)
